WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.896
Step 1. Open the preview.

1.2
00:00:01.896 --> 00:00:05.979
Here you check a patient's prescriptions before you bill them.

1.3
00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:11.444
Select View Rx on a row, and Care opens the Prescription Preview with the patient's

1.4
00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:12.471
details.

2.1
00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:14.712
Step 2. Check the medicines.

2.2
00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:18.693
To find a medicine, type its name in Search Medications.

2.3
00:00:18.693 --> 00:00:22.106
Each prescription shows who prescribed it, when,

2.4
00:00:22.106 --> 00:00:25.165
the patient's location and any note.

3.1
00:00:25.165 --> 00:00:29.502
Step 3. Print the prescriptions. Select Print Prescription.

3.2
00:00:29.502 --> 00:00:35.542
When more than one prescription is open, this button is Print All Prescriptions.

4.1
00:00:35.542 --> 00:00:38.864
Step 4. Complete or reactivate a prescription.

4.2
00:00:38.864 --> 00:00:44.205
If you do not bill an active prescription, select Mark as Completed in its menu.

4.3
00:00:44.205 --> 00:00:49.640
Reactivate Prescription makes a completed prescription active again.

5.1
00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:52.941
Step 5. Start billing. Select Start Billing.

5.2
00:00:52.941 --> 00:00:58.350
Care opens Bill Medications with the active prescriptions that are open in the

5.3
00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:03.300
preview.
